Current Version can be seen [[Vulkin|here]].

Originally, Vulkin was 2/5 and costed 5G to play to and deal 3 damage to a target of your choice, exactly the same as Justice's [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Punishment Punishment].

'''Alpha 2.7''' gave it -2 HP and -1 cost. '''Beta 4.8''' gave it -1 HP, dropping its HP even further to a mere 2, leaving it with 2/2 for 4G.

But not long after that, '''Beta 5.0 '''buffed Vulkin back up to its original state, but with +1/-1, so with 3/4 for 5G. '''Beta 6.5''' dropped its cost back to 4G, but made its ability deal only 2 damage instead of 3.

'''Beta 14.0''' dropped its ATK back to 2, leaving it with 2/4 for 4G, the same stats and cost as [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Vulkin's_Cloud its Cloud].

